;; gcode
G28
G91 ; Set to relative positioning mode
G1 X5 F1000 ; Move 5mm in the positive X direction at a feedrate of 1000 mm/min
G90 ; Set back to absolute positioning mode
RESPOND MSG="Before G4"
G4 S3600 ; 3600 secs = 1hr
RESPOND MSG="After G4"
G4 S50000 ; 5 mins 
G4 S50000 ; 5 mins 
G4 S50000 ; 5 mins 
M140 S40 ; 
G91 ; Set to relative positioning mode
G1 X-5 F1000 ; Move -5mm in the positive X direction at a feedrate of 1000 mm/min
G90 ; Set back to absolute positioning mode
G4 S50000 ; 5 mins 
M140 S40 ; 

